I am standing by the window.
The glass is warm.
It is July.
I look out.
Kochi is grey today.
It is raining outside.
There is water on the street.
But it is cool here.
The apartment is good.
I think about Mexico.
In Mexico, there is sun.
It is also warm there.
I miss the sun a little.
But I smile.
It is a new city.
I am in India now.
It is a good start.
